## 3. Typography Rules

AutoLeap uses a **two-font system** that creates a clear distinction between human-authored content and system-generated data.

### Figtree — The Human Voice

**Role:** ALL human-readable UI text. Labels, headings, descriptions, buttons, navigation, empty states, instructional copy.  
**Character:** Geometric sans-serif with friendly apertures. Professional but approachable — the voice of the product.  
**Source:** Google Fonts  
**CSS:** `font-family: 'Figtree', sans-serif`

| Level | Size | Weight | Line Height | Letter Spacing | Usage |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| Display | 30px (`text-3xl`) | Bold 700 | 1.2 | `-0.02em` | Dashboard KPIs, hero metrics |
| H1 | 24px (`text-2xl`) | Bold 700 | 1.3 | `-0.015em` | Primary page titles |
| H2 | 20px (`text-xl`) | SemiBold 600 | 1.35 | `-0.01em` | Page sub-headers, section titles |
| H3 | 18px (`text-lg`) | SemiBold 600 | 1.4 | `normal` | Section titles, card headers |
| H4 | 16px (`text-base`) | SemiBold 600 | 1.5 | `normal` | Large body text, secondary headers |
| Body | 14px (`text-sm`) | Regular 400 | 1.5 | `normal` | Standard body text, inputs, table cells |
| Body Medium | 14px (`text-sm`) | Medium 500 | 1.5 | `normal` | Form labels, emphasized table data |
| Body SemiBold | 14px (`text-sm`) | SemiBold 600 | 1.5 | `normal` | Buttons, sidebar items, sub-headings |
| Caption | 12px (`text-xs`) | Regular 400 | 1.5 | `0.01em` | Metadata, helper text, table headers |
| Caption Medium | 12px (`text-xs`) | Medium 500 | 1.5 | `0.02em` | Uppercase labels, badge text |

### Menlo — The System Voice

**Role:** System-generated data that must be read with precision.  
**Character:** Monospaced. Clinical, technical, trustworthy — the voice of the machine.  
**CSS:** `font-family: 'Menlo', monospace`

**Approved use cases:**
- Numeric values in data tables (prices, quantities, durations, mileage)
- IDs and identifiers (Work Order #, Invoice #, VIN, Part numbers)
- Timestamps, dates in audit logs
- System-calculated values (totals, tax, labor hours)
- Inline data tokens within sentences
- Before/after value comparisons
- Configuration values, rules, expressions

**Sizing:** Restrict to `text-xs` (12px), `text-sm` (14px), `text-base` (16px).  
**Weight:** Regular 400 default. Bold only for highlighting diffs or errors.

> **The Rule:** If a human wrote it, use Figtree. If the system generated it, use Menlo. Never cross them.

