## 4. Component Stylings

### Buttons

AutoLeap buttons use a **modern squircle radius** — 8px border-radius that aligns with cards, inputs, and the overall system geometry. Filled variants (Primary, Secondary Dark, Destructive, Warning) use a **subtle raised treatment** with a top-to-bottom gradient, inner highlight, and colored drop shadow — giving them a tactile, interactive feel. Non-filled variants (Dim, Outline, Ghost) remain flat.

**Shape:** `rounded-lg` (border-radius: 8px)  
**Height:** 36px (default) · 28px (xs) · 32px (sm) · 40px (lg) · 44px (xl)  
**Padding:** 16px horizontal × 8px vertical (`px-4 py-2`)  
**Font:** Figtree, 14px, SemiBold 600  
**Icon gap:** 6px between icon and text  
**Icon size:** 16px, stroke width 1.5px  
**Transition:** 120ms ease on all properties

#### Filled Buttons — Raised Treatment

All filled/solid-background buttons receive the following layered depth treatment:

```css
/* Example: Primary Filled */
background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #12877e, #0b635c);
box-shadow:
  inset 0 1px 0 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.2),   /* top inner highlight */
  inset 0 -1px 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15),        /* bottom inner darken */
  0 1px 2px 0 rgba(14,113,105,0.35),         /* colored drop shadow */
  0 2px 6px -1px rgba(14,113,105,0.2);       /* soft ambient */
text-shadow: 0 1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
```

Apply this pattern to ALL filled variants (Primary, Secondary Dark, Destructive, Warning), substituting the relevant color ramp for each. Non-filled variants (Dim, Outline, Ghost, White/Surface) do NOT get this treatment — they remain completely flat.

#### Variant Table

| Variant | Style | Background | Text | Border |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| **Primary Filled** | Raised | `linear-gradient(to bottom, #12877e, #0b635c)` | White | None |
| **Primary Dim** | Flat | AutoLeap Green 50 | AutoLeap Green 700 | 1px AutoLeap Green 100 |
| **Primary Outline** | Flat | Transparent | AutoLeap Green 700 | 1px AutoLeap Green 700 |
| **Primary Ghost** | Flat | Transparent | AutoLeap Green 700 | None |
| **Secondary Dark** | Raised | `linear-gradient(to bottom, #334155, #1e293b)` | White | None |
| **Secondary Dim** | Flat | Slate 100 | Slate 700 | 1px Slate 200 |
| **Secondary Outline** | Flat | Transparent | Slate 700 | 1px Slate 300 |
| **Secondary Ghost** | Flat | Transparent | Slate 600 | None |
| **White / Surface** | Flat | White | Slate 700 | 1px Slate 200 + `shadow-xs` |
| **Destructive Filled** | Raised | `linear-gradient(to bottom, #ef4444, #c52020)` | White | None |
| **Destructive Dim** | Flat | Red 50 | Red 700 | 1px Red 100 |
| **Destructive Outline** | Flat | Transparent | Red 600 | 1px Red 200 |
| **Destructive Ghost** | Flat | Transparent | Red 600 | None |
| **Warning Filled** | Raised | `linear-gradient(to bottom, #f59e0b, #c27c06)` | White | None |
| **Warning Dim** | Flat | Amber 50 | Amber 700 | 1px Amber 100 |
| **Warning Outline** | Flat | Transparent | Amber 600 | 1px Amber 100 |
| **Warning Ghost** | Flat | Transparent | Amber 600 | None |

#### States

- **Hover (Filled/Raised):** Gradient lightens by one shade, `transform: translateY(-0.5px)`, box-shadow expands (larger spread, stronger colored shadow). 120ms transition.
- **Hover (Flat):** Background shifts one shade darker (e.g., Green 50 → Green 100, Slate 100 → Slate 200). No lift.
- **Active/Pressed (Filled):** Gradient darkens, `transform: translateY(0.5px)`, box-shadow collapses to `inset 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.2)`.
- **Active/Pressed (Flat):** Background darkens one shade. No transform.
- **Disabled:** Opacity 0.4, `cursor: not-allowed`, no hover/active/transform effects.
- **Focus:** `box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px white, 0 0 0 4px #0E7169` — double ring with white gap. Filled buttons retain their gradient but replace drop shadow with the focus ring.
- **Loading:** Hide text (`color: transparent`), show a centered 15px spinner. Maintain button dimensions. Spinner color: white for filled variants, Slate 600 for flat variants.

#### Icon-Only Buttons

36 × 36px square with 8px radius. Must include a tooltip (`title` attribute or custom tooltip component). Available in all size variants: 28px (xs), 32px (sm), 36px (default), 40px (lg).

#### Compositions

- **Split Button:** Primary filled left section + darker chevron right section, wrapped in a single 8px-radius container with shared raised shadow. Divider: 1px `rgba(255,255,255,0.15)`.
- **Button Group (Segmented):** Adjacent outline buttons with `border-radius: 0` on inner edges, `8px` on outer ends. `margin-left: -1px` to collapse borders. Active segment: Slate 50 background.
- **Modal Footer:** Secondary Dim (Cancel) + Primary Filled (Confirm), left-to-right.
- **Destructive Dialog:** Secondary Outline (Cancel) + Destructive Filled (Confirm).
- **Toolbar Row:** White/Surface buttons for filters/columns, divider, outline for exports, flex-spacer, Primary Filled for main CTA.

#### Dark Mode Buttons

Filled/raised buttons retain their gradient treatment on dark surfaces — the colored shadow becomes more prominent against the dark background. Non-filled variants adapt:

| Variant | Background | Text | Border |
|---|---|---|---|
| Primary Filled | Same gradient (unchanged) | White | None |
| Secondary Dim | `rgba(255,255,255,0.08)` | White | `rgba(255,255,255,0.12)` |
| Secondary Outline | Transparent | `rgba(255,255,255,0.7)` | `rgba(255,255,255,0.15)` |
| Ghost | Transparent | Slate 300 | None |
| Destructive Filled | Same gradient (unchanged) | White | None |
| White / Surface | White | Slate 700 | Slate 200 (stands out on dark) |

