## 8. Responsive Behavior

### Breakpoints

| Name | Min Width | Layout Behavior |
|---|---|---|
| Mobile | 0px | Single column, stacked layouts, hamburger nav |
| Tablet | 768px | Two-column where natural, sidebar collapses |
| Desktop | 1024px | Full layout — sidebar + content |
| Wide | 1280px | Max content width reached, centered |

### Touch Targets

- **Minimum:** 36px × 36px for all interactive elements
- **Recommended:** 44px × 44px for primary actions on mobile
- **Spacing between targets:** Minimum 8px gap

### Collapsing Strategy

- **Sidebar:** Collapses to 56px icon-only rail on tablet, hidden behind hamburger on mobile
- **Tables:** Horizontal scroll with frozen first column on mobile, or transform to card-based list
- **Two-panel modals:** Stack vertically on mobile — sidebar becomes top tabs
- **Tabs:** Scroll horizontally if overflow, with fade indicators at edges
- **Form layouts:** Always single column on mobile, two-column optional on desktop

